(II) In acute triangle $ABC$, the sides opposite to angles $A$, $B$, $C$ are $a$, $b$, $c$ respectively, and satisfy $(2a-c)\cdot\cos B=b\cdot\cos C$, find the range of values for $f(2A)$.
